# The surface forms: forms rules write and typing turns into kernel forms; the emitter never sees them (the
# kernel's own forms are kernel/forms.wap)

# an item counted from 0 or a map's entry, `x[k]`, by the subject's type: only typing sees it, and it leaves as a Get,
# Get(xs, k + 1) or a map's Get(m, k) (core/analyze/data.wap), so it is a place as a Get is: `xs[0] = 5`
pattern Item = (Item $subject: Node $key: Node)

# which variable a name means in its block, by the word of its kind (core/bindings.wap): `global x` the program's x,
# Variable(x, global); `let x = 1` a new x here, Set(Variable(x, local), 1)
pattern Variable = (Variable $name: Symbol $kind: Symbol)
